<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine Sept industrial production down 1.2pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Ukraine Sept industrial production down 1.2pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial production in Ukraine declined by 1.2 percent in September compared to the previous month, the Statistics Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>UKRAINE INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION  SEPT 96  AUG 96  SEPT 95</p>
<p> mth/mth change (percent)	 -1.2     -1.2    +2.6</p>
<p> year/year change (percent)     -9.0     -5.5    -18.1</p>
<p>Ukrainian industrial output has declined every month this year exept in March, when it rose 10.1 percent over February levels.</p>
<p>The overall decline in production since the beginning of the year is 4.3 percent.</p>
<p>--Yuri Kulikov, Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
